{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.MassTheory.LeadingOrderTraceCoefficient","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.MassTheory.LeadingOrderTraceCoefficient","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:Mathlib.Tactic","lean:module:Mathlib.Algebra.DualNumber","lean:module:QOU.MassTheory.PairwiseChainLeadingOrder"],"declarations":35,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.MassTheory.c1_from_letters","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.MassTheory.c1_from_letters","kind":"theorem","line":268,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/5697c3130d79ead793a58c1a0a984a2e49b1365f/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MassTheory/LeadingOrderTraceCoefficient.lean#L268-L279","doc":"[★] reproduces all six recorded coefficients from the letter data alone:\n`c₁ = starSum(free) − starSum(atom)`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.MassTheory.star_He4Atom","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.MassTheory.star_He4Atom","kind":"theorem","line":264,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/5697c3130d79ead793a58c1a0a984a2e49b1365f/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MassTheory/LeadingOrderTraceCoefficient.lean#L264-L265","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.MassTheory.letters_He4Atom","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.MassTheory.letters_He4Atom","kind":"def","line":262,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/5697c3130d79ead793a58c1a0a984a2e49b1365f/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MassTheory/LeadingOrderTraceCoefficient.lean#L262-L263","doc":"Letter data `(w, c(σ⁽ˡ⁾))` of the 4He atom word, n = 12: [★] = 37/128. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.MassTheory.star_He4Free","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.MassTheory.star_He4Free","kind":"theorem","line":259,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/5697c3130d79ead793a58c1a0a984a2e49b1365f/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MassTheory/LeadingOrderTraceCoefficient.lean#L259-L260","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"